      <Desc>CHIEF PETTY OFFICER PRIDE DAY IS A SINGLE DAY NETWORKING, MENTORING, AND TEAM BUILDING EVENT TO CELEBRATE THE LEADERSHIP AND HISTORY OF NAVY CHIEF PETTY OFFICER. THIS CELEBRATION ALSO ALLOWS THE SAN DIEGO CPO COMMUNITY TO PROVIDE A DAY OF SERVICE TO THE LOCAL COMMUNITY AS WELL AS TO WITNESS NAVY TEAMWORK AND LEADERSHIP DURING THIS PUBLIC EVENT WITH OVER 3,000 PARTICIPANTS. ACTIVE DUTY, RETIRED, AND GUESTS ARE ALL WELCOME.</Desc>
